{
  "name": "iPad Kids \u2014 HEVC/SDR mp4 (2d-animation + standard)",
  "description": "Derivative iPad-kids copies. Branch profile by /2d-animation/ path segment and HDR by checkHdr. HDR->SDR via tonemap_cuda bt2390 (param=0.5, limited range, 10-bit p010). Fully GPU-resident: nvdec -> scale_cuda -> tonemap_cuda -> hevc_nvenc, no hwupload/hwdownload. standard = <=1080p ceiling (downscale-only) p4 cq32; 2d-animation = NATIVE res (no scale) p3 cq34. HDR and SDR share the same cq per profile. mp4, AAC stereo, no subs. Integrity guard then Move To Directory (library output_dir, keep relative path). Never replaces originals. Requires the Tdarr container's shipped jellyfin-ffmpeg: tonemap_cuda is a jellyfin-only filter, and -tune uhq is deliberately absent because jellyfin-ffmpeg compiles it out (nv-codec-headers n12.0.16.1).",
  "tags": "video,hevc,ipad,kids,tonemap,derivative",
  "flowPlugins": [
